('51','0','crop_pattern','economy','Major crop pattern','Wheat (Rabi) · Rice & sugarcane (Kharif)','District agriculture page identifies wheat as the major Rabi crop and rice/sugarcane as major Kharif crops; Super Basmati is a notable crop.','District / Shahkot agricultural context','agriculture','https://nankana.punjab.gov.pk/agriculture_cropping_pattern','District Nankana Sahib — Agriculture Cropping Pattern','2026-08-29','20','1','1','2026-08-29 22:37:11'),
('52','0','district_industries','economy','District industry snapshot','151 rice mills · 112 petrol pumps · 92 brick kilns · 12 textile mills','District-level profile also lists 5 flour mills, 12 marble factories, 2 soap factories and 1 sugar mill. These figures are district-wide, not Shahkot-city counts.','District context','district_profile','https://nankana.punjab.gov.pk/district_profile','District Nankana Sahib — District Profile','2026-08-29','30','0','1','2026-08-29 22:37:11'),
