('54','0','nau_lakh_hazari','heritage','Shrine of Hazrat Abul Khair Nau Lakh Hazari','Historic protected shrine in Shahkot','Department of Archaeology & Museums records the shrine as a historic monument/tomb associated with Abu Alkhair Syed Murad Ali Shah Bukhari (Noulakha), with a 23 March Urs gathering.','City / heritage','heritage','https://doam.gov.pk/public/sites/10315','Department of Archaeology & Museums — Shrine of Hazrat Abul Khair Nau Lakh Hazari','2026-08-29','10','1','1','2026-08-29 22:37:11'),
('55','0','nau_lakh_status','heritage','Heritage protection','Protected under Punjab special-premises law','The archaeology record lists the site under the Punjab Special Premises (Preservation) Ordinance, 1985.','City / heritage','heritage','https://doam.gov.pk/public/sites/10315','Department of Archaeology & Museums — Shrine of Hazrat Abul Khair Nau Lakh Hazari','2026-08-29','20','0','1','2026-08-29 22:37:11'),
