('206','13.2.0','update_1d9777daee68b6d0.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260830_210545_pre_update_v13.1.4_47095f2a.zip','Adds a tenant-level Platform Module Visibility Manager backed by the existing access-control feature override layer. Administrators can enable/disable individual public features or whole module groups without deleting content, changing package definitions or rewriting the native public menu. No scanner or new public request-time hook is installed. SQL migrations: 13.2.0','2026-08-30 21:35:54'),
('207','13.3.0','update_a84d99d587d738e8.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260830_214624_pre_update_v13.2.0_2805bc0f.zip','Adds a tenant-scoped Unified Notifications & Alert Control Center with channel policies, event rules and reusable notification policy helpers. It does not inject a request-time sender, duplicate cron workers, alter SMTP secrets, or rewrite the native public menu. SQL migrations: 13.3.0','2026-08-30 22:16:33'),
('208','13.3.1','update_2f760193eeffb5a9.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260830_215213_pre_update_v13.3.0_211581e0.zip','Replaces Google Maps as the default map dependency with OpenFreeMap + MapLibre no-key mode, keeps Leaflet/OpenStreetMap as a no-key alternative and Google Maps as an optional legacy provider. Adds a lightweight public fallback bridge that recovers common map containers after Google authentication failures without adding a request-time scanner. SQL migrations: 13.3.1','2026-08-30 22:22:22'),
('209','13.3.2','update_ca78989acf063454.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260830_220152_pre_update_v13.3.1_12528b0a.zip','Fixes v13.3.1 admin asset-loader regression that kept the old v13.1.4 map provider UI active. Loads the no-key provider UI correctly, normalizes legacy Auto to OpenFreeMap, forces OpenFreeMap as the tenant default, and updates the public map bridge to v13.3.2 while preserving Google as an optional manual provider. SQL migrations: 13.3.2','2026-08-30 22:32:02'),
('210','13.3.3','update_a6f6faee9e3b2df4.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260830_221436_pre_update_v13.3.2_f5a64155.zip','Global no-API-key map replacement. Intercepts legacy Google Maps JS on public and admin HTML, disables the old Google-only maps guard in no-key mode, supplies a Google Maps compatibility shim for legacy map constructors/markers, and recovers City Map, homepage, dashboard, business, property, event, doctor, ride and location map containers with OpenFreeMap/MapLibre. SQL migrations: 13.3.3','2026-08-30 22:44:45'),
('211','13.3.4','update_d65648c072644ad1.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260830_232857_pre_update_v13.3.3_7faf622d.zip','Full-widget OpenFreeMap/MapLibre fix plus site-wide marker-data recovery. Makes legacy map hosts fill their grid/column height, harvests existing legacy/global marker payloads, and lazily fetches bounded tenant-safe coordinates from map-capable business/event/property/doctor/job/service tables only when a map is present. SQL migrations: 13.3.4','2026-08-30 23:59:06');
INSERT INTO `system_updates` (`id`,`version`,`file_name`,`status`,`backup_path`,`notes`,`created_at`) VALUES
('212','13.3.5','update_497f5ae537e2a0cc.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260830_233853_pre_update_v13.3.4_f357cddc.zip','Adds a research-based Shahkot demo data manager with a curated public-directory dataset. It replaces only explicitly detectable dummy/demo rows, preserves real rows/users/history/uploads, omits personal contact details/ratings/hours, and uses schema-adaptive inserts with map-ready Shahkot coordinates. SQL migrations: 13.3.5','2026-08-31 00:09:02'),
('213','13.3.6','update_8b955d23e0e00cb1.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260830_234606_pre_update_v13.3.5_791e26c9.zip','Fixes duplicate Map Control rendering, corrects the Shahkot default map center, excludes v13.3.5 approximate demo coordinates from map output, and overlays only verified public-map Shahkot locations. Updates the demo-data manager to replace prior tagged demo rows with the verified dataset when Safe Replace is run. SQL migrations: 13.3.6','2026-08-31 00:16:15'),
('214','13.4.0','update_ba47b29eb80474d0.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260831_000446_pre_update_v13.3.6_53f9f980.zip','Adds Location Intelligence & Nearby Discovery on top of the verified no-key map platform: marker clustering, search/type filters, browser Near Me distance ranking, marker popups, nearby list synchronization, a bounded map-safe discovery endpoint, and an admin Location Intelligence control center. No approximate coordinates are generated. SQL migrations: 13.4.0','2026-08-31 00:34:55'),
('215','13.5.0','update_bd2e9b1bf02b0438.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260831_001103_pre_update_v13.4.0_d7064395.zip','Adds the City Discovery Content Engine: homepage discovery cards and category highlights generated only from verified/genuine map-ready Shahkot data, plus an admin control center. No fabricated popularity, ratings, reviews or coordinates are created. Native front menu remains untouched. SQL migrations: 13.5.0','2026-08-31 00:41:12'),
('216','13.6.0','update_34e1d676ae92fc4c.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260831_002428_pre_update_v13.5.0_8b128688.zip','Transforms Education Network into a complete tenant-scoped multi-teaching LMS with institutes, courses, teacher teams, batches, curriculum, student enrollment, assignments, quizzes, attendance, announcements, gradebook, progress and certificates. No demo courses/users are created and the native front menu is not rewritten. SQL migrations: 13.6.0','2026-08-31 00:54:39'),
('217','13.7.0','update_d6bc3b062e48fb5a.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260831_003941_pre_update_v13.6.0_1121da55.zip','Upgrades Local Classifieds into a full tenant-scoped marketplace with OLX-style discovery, multi-step ad posting, photos, category attributes, search/filters, favorites, buyer-seller chat, seller dashboard, moderation, reports, promotions, expiry/renewals, no-key map integration and safety blocks for restricted goods. Existing data and native front menu are preserved. SQL migrations: 13.7.0','2026-08-31 01:09:51'),
('218','13.8.0','update_6e8daf8aad4a8f63.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260831_010406_pre_update_v13.7.0_7a00163e.zip','Upgrades Local Service Marketplace into Service Provider Pro: separate provider applications and approval access, service profiles and offerings, customer requests, provider quotes, booking/work-order lifecycle, in-app booking chat, completed-order reviews, admin operations, provider packages, paid package verification, Fast Service entitlement, featured/search-priority foundations and tenant-scoped controls. Existing data and native front menu are preserved. SQL migrations: 13.8.0','2026-08-31 01:34:17'),
('219','13.8.1','update_932a045b293c7720.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260831_010733_pre_update_v13.8.0_e2305997.zip','Targeted hotfix for blank Admin Classifieds page: fixes invalid SQL alias selection in reports/promotions queries, adds defensive panel loading, and corrects DATE_ADD interval bindings in classifieds actions. Existing data and native front menu are preserved. SQL migrations: 13.8.1','2026-08-31 01:37:43'),
('220','13.8.2','update_898b53e6b5fbbaf6.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260831_011650_pre_update_v13.8.1_611f0ad7.zip','Consolidated runtime SQL audit hotfix for Service Provider Pro and remaining Classifieds query aliases. Fixes blank admin/services.php plus latent provider/customer/detail route failures. Preserves all existing data, uploads, permissions and native public menu. SQL migrations: 13.8.2','2026-08-31 01:47:00'),
('221','13.8.3','update_fb34f316f50730b9.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260831_140709_pre_update_v13.8.2_06d57195.zip','Full project production-backup audit and stabilization. Repairs central admin runtime compatibility, warning storms, services shell, legacy map loaders, SQL interval defects, stale map/settings assets, route compatibility and safe audit controls without deleting genuine content. SQL migrations: 13.8.3','2026-08-31 14:37:38'),
('222','13.8.4','update_7aa664d600c73a00.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260831_141549_pre_update_v13.8.3_03edf675.zip','Landing page regression hotfix. Restores native menu isolation and constrains OpenFreeMap to a dedicated homepage widget without resizing parent layout. Preserves v13.8.3 audit fixes. SQL migrations: 13.8.4','2026-08-31 14:45:59'),
('223','13.8.5','update_405e260152fb1a66.zip','success','/home/shahkotp/public_html/storage/backups/ShahkotPK_20260831_144224_pre_update_v13.8.4_73dc20f6.zip','Native front-menu recovery. Replaces stale Step-3 managed-navigation assets, removes #sk1302-public-nav, restores native navigation visibility and adds a bounded cache-safe menu lock while preserving v13.8.4 map containment. SQL migrations: 13.8.5','2026-08-31 15:12:34');
